{"1357150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gassy Man", "steam_appid": 1357150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Buzz</h1><p>We want your feedback on Gassy Man! What do you like? What doi you love? What do you hate? Do you want to see Gassy Man developed into a full-length game? Updates and announcements will be posted here!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/extras/5a42b11a9209dc557512e936291501cc.avif?t=1595267800\" width=616 height=353 /></span><br>The free-to-play version of Gassy Man, a game in development from All Day Breakfast Productions. <br>In Gassy Man our hero (Mike), must use his strangely noxious super power to defend the Earth from alien invaders!<br>Use the power of your own gas to fly across the city and knock UFOs out of the sky to save humanity from extraterrestrial invasion forces.<br>This game is in Beta and we would love to get player feedback to help make it better.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/extras/aa2adbf3ddddb235519355ec8a6ab60e.avif?t=1595267800\" width=800 height=600 /></span><br>Simple gameplay mechanics utilize the directional arrows. Up to fly, left and right to move or float in that direction.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/extras/112081384866e51b899e260d6fbdd49f.avif?t=1595267800\" width=800 height=596 /></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/extras/5a42b11a9209dc557512e936291501cc.avif?t=1595267800\" width=616 height=353 /></span><br>The free-to-play version of Gassy Man, a game in development from All Day Breakfast Productions. <br>In Gassy Man our hero (Mike), must use his strangely noxious super power to defend the Earth from alien invaders!<br>Use the power of your own gas to fly across the city and knock UFOs out of the sky to save humanity from extraterrestrial invasion forces.<br>This game is in Beta and we would love to get player feedback to help make it better.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/extras/aa2adbf3ddddb235519355ec8a6ab60e.avif?t=1595267800\" width=800 height=600 /></span><br>Simple gameplay mechanics utilize the directional arrows. Up to fly, left and right to move or float in that direction.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/extras/112081384866e51b899e260d6fbdd49f.avif?t=1595267800\" width=800 height=596 /></span>", "short_description": "Use your gassy superpowers to fly and knock the UFO invaders out of the sky! Use the arrow keys to fly and float through the sky!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/header.jpg?t=1595267800", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1595267800", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1595267800", "website": "http://www.alldaybreakfast.games", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> dual-core AMD or Intel or greater recommended<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 195 MB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Gassy Man is TM & Copyright of All Day Breakfast Productions and Mike Gagnon 2020", "developers": ["Mike Gagnon"], "publishers": ["All Day Breakfa